<title>SOUTH KOREA: Tongyang Sec opens Shanghai office.</title>
<headline>Tongyang Sec opens Shanghai office.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Tongyang Securities opened an office in Shanghai on Friday to prepare for the opening of the Chinese financial market, a company statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;We set up the office to strengthen bilateral cooperation ahead of financial market opening in China and to secure a foothhold there,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>This is the second South Korean securities firm to open a representative office in Shanghai, following Daewoo Securities.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
